(module "SW_Toggle_CK7000_DPDT_PC_Vertical" (layer F.Cu)
  (descr "Mini toggle DPDT, C&K 7000 / Dailywell 1M straight PC terminals (M2), rows 4.83 mm, pins 4.70 mm, origin = bushing axis (1 mm centre mark hole). Bat toward pin 1/4 closes 2-3 and 5-6.")
